==== PoE MOD EdgeRouter X ====

ETH0 PoE IN to PoE OUT  ->  find diode D26 and reverse it


add PoE to ETH1 

  - remove  R137 & R138
  - connect R137 pad to R131
  - connect R138 pad to gnd or R131

add PoE to ETH2

  - remove  R142 & R143
  - connect R142 pad to R131
  - connect R143 pad to gnd or R131

add PoE to ETH3

  - remove  R126 & R127
  - connect R126 pad to R131
  - connect R127 pad to gnd or R131

transformer MAX 600mA!


